<LanguageData>
  <VPE_EltexMeteor.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questDescription->A large meteorite has struck ground nearby. It has left behind a lump of eltex. Eltex can be used to create psyfocus-enhancing gear, or sold to the Empire to gain honor.
You can send a mining party to retrieve it, but chances are if you wait long enough, someone else will lay claim to it.-->
    <li>questDescription-&gt;一块巨大的陨石撞击了附近的地面。它留下了一块埃尔克斯。 Eltex 可用于制造精神集中增强装备，或出售给帝国以获得荣誉。
你可以派遣采矿队取回它，但如果你等待足够长的时间，很可能会有其他人声称拥有它。</li>
  </VPE_EltexMeteor.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <VPE_EltexMeteor.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: questName->Eltex Meteor-->
    <li>questName-&gt;埃尔泰克斯流星</li>
  </VPE_EltexMeteor.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName]-->
  <VPE_EltexMeteor.root.nodes.7.node.nodes.0.label>任务已过期：[resolvedQuestName]</VPE_EltexMeteor.root.nodes.7.node.nodes.0.label>
  <!--EN: Others have mined the Eltex meteor. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired.-->
  <VPE_EltexMeteor.root.nodes.7.node.nodes.0.text>其他人开采了埃尔泰克斯流星。任务 [resolvedQuestName] 已过期。</VPE_EltexMeteor.root.nodes.7.node.nodes.0.text>
